Real customer stories go here, one .md per story, matching the
`success-stories` schema in src/content.config.ts.

This directory is intentionally empty and intentionally tracked: the collection
globs it, and without the directory every build logs a glob-loader warning for
a path that does not exist. /success-stories renders an honest empty state and
is noindex while this stays empty. Do not invent a customer to fill it.
